    "detailed_description": "<h1>Trading Cards &amp; Achievements</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unlock 6 exclusive levels of closeness badges \u2013 from awkward to unbreakable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/364a6c90879a1955ac2c3602910966d6.avif?t=1747073683\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Collect 10 Steam Trading Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/3a670fc5bf1c441cd076eb542006af01.avif?t=1747073683\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get profile avatars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your style and progress with our unlockable achievement system. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some days, you open your computer, stare at the empty screen, and sigh. Everything works as usual: the mouse, the keyboard, the deadlines.<br> But today... something feels different. Someone is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little girl with curious eyes.<br>A silent knight standing on your screen, following every move of your mouse.<br>Or maybe a grumpy cat, dancing in the corner like it\u2019s saying, \u201cHey, look at me!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Sisters</strong> is not a game you play. It\u2019s a feeling - the feeling that someone is there with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soft interactions. Gentle dialogues. Little expressions that make you smile when you\u2019re stressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t control them. You stay with them.<br>And sometimes, that\u2019s exactly what we need to get through the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many characters - many styles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one or bring <i>many</i> to your screen at the same time: fantasy girls, cat-girls, zombie girls, or even a big-head girl who loves to dance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has their own personality and surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/5daf1a3d7a1efbe87c4edb898e22681f.avif?t=1747073683\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Virtual characters living on your desktop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters move, react in real time, and \u201clive\u201d on your computer screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They follow your mouse, act on their own, and can be placed anywhere with Freehand mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/08e78522326ed778bea41d3fc612d441.poster.avif?t=1747073683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/08e78522326ed778bea41d3fc612d441.webm?t=1747073683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/08e78522326ed778bea41d3fc612d441.mp4?t=1747073683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact &amp; earn love points</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact to earn \u201cLove Points\u201d - unlock new outfits, actions, and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold your mouse for 3 seconds to drag them around the screen - or just watch how they react to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/0006ca2df9633ec8ddbeb16ba5812933.poster.avif?t=1747073683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/0006ca2df9633ec8ddbeb16ba5812933.webm?t=1747073683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/extras/0006ca2df9633ec8ddbeb16ba5812933.mp4?t=1747073683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom display modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resize, Freehand, Automatic, and Interactive display options to match your mood.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium items unlock pose changes, animations, and special expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open platform &amp; AI background support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works well with other apps like Wallpaper Engine, Tiny Pasture, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use AI tools to create background scenes that match your chosen character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>FINAL NOTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world outside can be loud and tiring - but your desktop can be a quiet start for something soft, cute, and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Sisters is not just a game. It\u2019s a virtual friend, a small space to breathe, a little emotional vitamin for you every time you turn on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019ve ever felt like you\u2019re working alone\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you ever needed <i>someone</i> - just to be there\u2026<br>Let Your Sisters appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag them onto your screen. Talk. Smile. And let them remind you that even the smallest things can make a day feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Get Your Sisters now and turn your desktop into a space full of joy, surprises, and little moments that make life better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
